I found two likely safety defects: rotation checks leave gaps between sampled poses, and the “straight” connector can include lateral motion that a differential-drive rover cannot execute. Rotation reservations also use chords between samples, which can omit part of a corner’s arc. I’m constructing reproducible cases for these and checking the FSM handoff.

